#: web/src/routes/privacy/+page.svelte:86
msgid ""
"Single sign-on: if the operator enables sign-in through an OpenID Connect"
" provider such as Authelia and you link it to your account, the server "
"stores the provider's identifier for you (issuer and subject) and the "
"email address the provider confirmed, so it can recognise you. The "
"provider handles the sign-in itself under its own terms. You can unlink "
"it in your account settings."
msgstr ""
"Single sign-on: if the operator enables sign-in through an OpenID Connect"
" provider such as Authelia and you link it to your account, the server "
"stores the provider's identifier for you (issuer and subject) and the "
